  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Current gain $\\beta=\\frac{\\Delta I_C}{I_B}$\nVoltage gain $\\mathrm{A}_{\\mathrm{v}}=$ Current gain $\\times$ Resistance gain $=\\beta \\frac{R_L}{R_{B E}}$\nPower gain $A_p=(\\text { Current gain })^2 \\times$ Resistance gain\n$$\n=\\beta^2 \\frac{R_L}{R_{B E}}\n$$",
